     <h1 class="title" title="Places to visit in Mehrauli">Kinari Bazar</h1>
     <div class="entry-content">
<span style="COLOR: #000000">
If you are visiting Delhi, you will most likely do shopping in Connaught Place, Chandni chowk, Karol Bagh, Lajpat nagar, South Extension, Rani Bagh.
<br/>
<h3>Why to go to Kinari Bazar</h3>
From kinari Bazar you can buy special clothing for marriage, engagement.  Clothing like Lehnga, Sarees, Lehanga, Dupatta, Salwar-Kameez, Kurtas, Groom Sherwanis, turbans. <br />
Kinari bazar/market has speciality in  borders and embellishments of all types. 

<br/>

<h3>Bargaining</h3>
Yes you should bargain in Kinari Bazar.

<br/>
<h3>Festival Season</h3>
On dusshera, Diwali, Karwa choauth you can buy tradtional, festival related items in Festival season.

 <br/>   
    <h3>Best time to visit</h3>       
   Best time to visit : 12 PM to 4 PM. Avoid Rainy days. 
 Kinari Bazar opens on Monday to Saturday. Kinari bazar is closed on Sunday

                            
